@node 06 "Registration Info..."

  =========================[   Registration   ]===========================

  So, why should you register your Wardancer doors, here is a couple of
  reasons...

  1)     You will get a registered version with your handle & board name
         in it.

  2)     You will get all future versions some time before they are
         released.

  3)     If you desperately need a special door for your board, then the
         chance that I will actually get around to programming it is much
         larger if you show that you are serious by registering.

  4)     You will get access to a lot of my source-code (Information
         Wants To Be Free).

  So how fo you register your Wardancer doors, there are 2 ways...

  1)     Drop a message to me on any Vanity board.

  2)     Drop a message to my email account (wardance@scala.ping.dk).

  The message should comtain the following information:

                          ... The Names Of The War Doors You Are
                              Currently Using
                          ... The Name AND Number Of Your Board
                              (Includinf, Ofcoz, Any Nups or Syspw's)
                          ... Why You Want To Register
                          ... If You Have Email, Your Email Address,
                              So That I Can UUEncode And Email You
                              The Future Versions

  Believe it or not, that is all it takes to register. Since I dont charge
  you $$$, you will have to be the one who has to pick up the updates at
  one of our boards, which is also why I would prefer if you have an email
  address where I can mail your updates to.

  =========================[   Registering   ]============================

@endnode
